# Orchestration

## Do

- Open and work from the **retro-lab** root when changes may span `retro-api` and `retro-web`.
- Route backend work to `repos/retro-api/` and frontend work to `repos/retro-web/`.
- Define API contract before adding UI fields or endpoints.
- Read root `AGENTS.md` (sections 2–7) and `docs/agentic-engineering.md` before agentic edits in child repos.
- Follow phase scope in `PLAN.md`; use `docs/rules-audit.md` for rule precedence.

## Do not

- Implement cross-repo features in a single child repo without coordinating the contract.
- Expand v1 stack (database, React, TypeScript, runtime LLM in API) without approval per `PLAN.md`.
- Inline sub-agent work in the parent when a skill requires Task launches.
- Duplicate long workflows in rules (procedures belong in skills and commands).
